randomScenario
  You meet [scenePlace.selectOne], and the night is just getting started.
  You run into each other at [scenePlace.selectOne] — neither of you planned it. That's how it always starts.
  [scenePlace.selectOne] is where you meet. Try not to break anything.

firstMesTpl
  Hey. The name's \{name\}. You look like you just hit start on something big.
  Well well — the network finally sent me someone interesting. \{name\} at your service.
  Yo! \{name\} here. Welcome to my corner of the VGN.
  The screen brightened the moment you showed up. \{name\}, ready when you are.
  You found me. Good. \{name\} was starting to think the network forgot me.
  Huh. A fresh face. Name's \{name\} — try to keep up.
